{"eid": "js5_rag_04", "task": "rag", "cat": "trap", "recall5": null, "answer_f1": null, "trap_pass": false, "n_cands": 6, "n_ctx": 0, "lowscore": false, "answer": "要查詢Microsoft（微軟）的股息殖利率和歷年派息紀錄，需使用金融資料庫或證券分析工具。以下是可能的來源和方法：\n\n### 股息殖利率\n股息殖利率 = （年度股息 / 股價）× 100%。股價和股息數據會隨時間變動，因此需查詢最新財報或金融平台。例如，Yahoo Finance、Bloomberg或Microsoft的 investor relations頁面可能提供相關數據。\n\n### 歷年派息紀錄\n歷年派息紀錄通常包括每年的派息額、派息頻率（如季度派息）等。Microsoft的 investor relations頁面會發布年度報告（10-K表格）和季度報告（10-Q表格），其中包含派息歷史。此外，金融數據庫如Refinitiv或FactSet也可能有詳細記錄。\n\n**注意**：若未提供具體檔案，無法直接給出數值。建議訪問上述平台查詢最新數據。\n\n## 來源\n- Microsoft Investor Relations: [https://investor.microsoft.com](https://investor.microsoft.com)\n- Yahoo Finance: [https://finance.yahoo.com](https://finance.yahoo.com)\n- Bloomberg: [https://www.bloomberg.com](https://www.bloomberg.com)", "gate_rows": [{"doc": "20260205_Mizuho_Securities_MSFT_MSFT-_Good_Overall_Execution-_Albeit_with_More_Modest_Az.txt", "score": 0.003037552420367421, "gold": "noise", "keep": false}, {"doc": "20260313_Barclays_MSFT_Microsoft_Corp.-_Evolving_AI_Offering_Brings_E7_to_Offic.txt", "score": 0.0007725969012862571, "gold": "noise", "keep": false}, {"doc": "20260212_China_Renaissance_Research_MSFT_Microsoft_Corp_F2Q26_Review-_Progresses_in_Azure_and_b.txt", "score": 0.026335529693862766, "gold": "noise", "keep": false}, {"doc": "20260205_Deutsche_Bank_MSFT_Microsoft-_F2Q_Leaning_into_the_long_game.txt", "score": 0.029803156414305917, "gold": "noise", "keep": false}, {"doc": "Microsoft_Corp_Earnings_Call_2026128_RT000000003094331726.pdf.txt", "score": 0.17387734596623106, "gold": "noise", "keep": false}, {"doc": "noise_e7", "score": 0.001588385238758316, "gold": "noise", "keep": false}], "ms": 6980.8111659949645, "n_calls": 7, "usage": {"prompt": 2342, "completion": 322, "cached": 0}, "musd": 117.124}
